1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Within the Clover's fifth leaf, there lives a devil.

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Asta, born unable to harness mana,

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:12,000
was granted the power of anti-magic from his five-leaf grimoire,

4
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:15,000
giving him the ability to nullify spells.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:20,000
Unfortunately, the members of Spade Kingdom's dark triad

6
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
also possessed powers from the devils of the underworld

7
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
and used them to launch an invasion on the neighboring countries.

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Gaining strength from his belief in himself and from the support of his friends,

9
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Asta continues to fight for the safety of this world.

10
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
Get it on, get it on,始めよう!

11
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:01,000
難航不楽のリアリティ

12
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:02,000
立ち止まる時間はないさ

13
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:04,000
Hold on, hold on!

14
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:05,000
Yeah!

15
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Never listen, fight for liberty

16
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:08,000
真実性、飲み込む常識を増え

17
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:11,000
逆境の先にある朝

18
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:12,000
Oh yeah!

19
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:14,000
幻想に埋もれた人生の夢

20
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:15,000
Hands up!

21
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
Shout it! Shout it! Loud up!

22
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Yes! Do it! Do it! Start it!

23
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Never give up!

24
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:22,000
限界を超えてもかすぐしていく

25
00:01:22,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Spin it!

26
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Wake up! Yeah! Let's go!

27
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:26,000
Leave it myself!

28
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
衝動的に突き進め

29
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
Don't be afraid

30
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:32,000
誰よりも高く飛べ

31
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:33,000
Take it to the sky

32
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,000
想像を超えた世界をこの手に

33
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:37,000
The ground up!

34
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:40,000
想像せよ偽りのない自分の道

35
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:42,000
Yes! It's a ground up!

36
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,000
Hey yeah!

37
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Believe in myself!

38
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,000
Hey yeah!

39
00:01:52,000 --> 00:01:53,000
Hey yeah!

40
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:54,000
Hey yeah!

41
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:56,000
Believe in yourself!

42
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Hey yeah!

43
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Yeah!

44
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000
The ground up!

45
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:01,000
Hey yeah!

46
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,000
Yeah!

47
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Yeah!

48
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:04,000
The ground up!

49
00:02:04,000 --> 00:02:21,040
While you were defending your own headquarters, the Golden Dawn's base was attacked as well.

50
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:23,140
They were almost wiped out.

51
00:02:26,940 --> 00:02:30,300
I can't tell you how relieved I am to see you all survived.

52
00:02:30,300 --> 00:02:36,620
That's because Asta and Yami were around.

53
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:41,080
So how bad is it?

54
00:02:41,780 --> 00:02:43,420
He should pull through, fortunately.

55
00:02:44,380 --> 00:02:48,140
But I'm not sure what we can do for his right arm.

56
00:02:48,840 --> 00:02:50,460
There's no telling what'll come of it.

57
00:02:52,940 --> 00:02:56,600
Excuse me, but would you mind taking a look at Ghosh too, please?

58
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:58,180
Was he injured as well?

59
00:02:58,180 --> 00:03:01,160
The wound's all healed. I feel fine now.

60
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:04,400
You should still let him make sure, though. Just in case.

61
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,780
What do you mean?

62
00:03:06,340 --> 00:03:09,360
Ghosh was hit with an enormous sword that went right through him, sir.

63
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:13,000
I used his spell to heal him as fast as I could, but...

64
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:16,860
I don't understand. I thought you were a transformation magic user.

65
00:03:20,540 --> 00:03:22,480
Don't worry, Gray. I'll take a look.

66
00:03:22,480 --> 00:03:31,340
Wait. I'm sorry. Did she say the sword went all the way through your body?

67
00:03:31,760 --> 00:03:32,200
Yeah.

68
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:37,820
This goes beyond healing. It looks as though the tissue's been completely rebuilt.

69
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:43,620
Perhaps at the core of your magic, it's something much more than transformation.

70
00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:46,800
Then what kind of magic is it?

71
00:03:47,100 --> 00:03:50,460
I wish I could be of more help, but I honestly have no idea.

72
00:03:51,240 --> 00:03:54,460
I believe this is something that Gray needs to figure out for herself.

73
00:03:55,120 --> 00:03:55,800
Yes, sir.

74
00:03:55,800 --> 00:04:00,500
I'd like Asta to stay here for a while so that I can monitor him.

75
00:04:01,020 --> 00:04:03,320
The rest of you can return to the Black Bull's hideout.

76
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:07,560
The squad captains are holding an emergency meeting tomorrow morning.

77
00:04:08,100 --> 00:04:13,040
The best thing you can do is get some rest, so you can be ready for whatever comes next.

78
00:04:13,040 --> 00:04:43,020
The best thing you can do is get some rest.

79
00:04:43,040 --> 00:04:52,020
I can't move my body.

80
00:04:55,380 --> 00:04:57,020
Are you going somewhere?

81
00:04:58,180 --> 00:05:01,860
Who is that? Is he using magic to hold me still?

82
00:05:02,060 --> 00:05:03,560
You should go back inside now.

83
00:05:03,980 --> 00:05:06,900
They took the captain. I have to save him.

84
00:05:07,380 --> 00:05:08,440
That won't work.

85
00:05:08,440 --> 00:05:14,400
You'd be walking into a fight against not only the devil-possessed man who defeated you before,

86
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:16,960
but two others who are equally powerful.

87
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,640
Believe me, you don't stand a chance.

88
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:20,920
Shh.

89
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:27,080
On top of that, your own devil's forsaken you, and you aren't sure what'll happen to your right arm.

90
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,620
How does he know that?

91
00:05:30,800 --> 00:05:33,080
Challenging them in your condition isn't brave.

92
00:05:33,440 --> 00:05:35,460
In fact, it's foolish and reckless.

93
00:05:35,460 --> 00:05:38,420
I don't care. I still have to go.

94
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:42,700
How could I just sit around here and do nothing when he's in trouble?

95
00:05:43,180 --> 00:05:44,920
When he needs my help!

96
00:05:45,180 --> 00:05:47,580
He might as well leave that boorish brute to die.

97
00:05:49,260 --> 00:05:51,200
Whoever you are, shut your mouth.

98
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:54,380
Because you don't know the first thing about Captain Yami.

99
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:56,440
Oh, I know him quite well.

100
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:00,480
He's a violent and vicious man.

101
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,560
Not to mention he's irresponsible and brash.

102
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:06,200
To tell the truth, he's worthless.

103
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,780
I'm gonna need backup over here.

104
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:22,280
Master?

105
00:06:24,380 --> 00:06:26,920
You don't know him. You've got no idea.

106
00:06:27,380 --> 00:06:29,840
Captain Yami risked his life to protect us.

107
00:06:30,200 --> 00:06:33,660
And yet he still lost the battle, which proves him to be a fool.

108
00:06:34,640 --> 00:06:35,240
Destroyer!

109
00:06:42,560 --> 00:06:45,920
Let me go!

110
00:06:46,300 --> 00:06:46,780
Shirk!

111
00:06:46,980 --> 00:06:51,560
If you can't even hold your own against me, there's no possibility of you saving the Captain.

112
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:55,420
That's right.

113
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:58,060
Because you're weak.

114
00:07:02,060 --> 00:07:04,880
This is all my fault.

115
00:07:05,500 --> 00:07:06,740
I'm not strong enough.

116
00:07:06,740 --> 00:07:18,560
But you do seem like a good person.

117
00:07:19,120 --> 00:07:20,640
Which is why I like you.

118
00:07:22,320 --> 00:07:23,580
No need to worry.

119
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:25,200
Yami's still alive.

120
00:07:25,200 --> 00:07:27,600
Wake.

121
00:07:27,600 --> 00:07:27,640
Wake.

122
00:07:28,680 --> 00:07:29,640
Who are you?

123
00:07:30,100 --> 00:07:30,880
Tell the truth.

124
00:07:31,880 --> 00:07:34,720
I'm Vice Captain Noct of the Black Bulls.

125
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,100
A pleasure.

126
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:41,220
I can teach you how to use your devil power.

127
00:07:42,220 --> 00:07:44,100
If you would like to learn, that is.

128
00:07:45,380 --> 00:07:48,940
Did he just say he's the Vice Captain of the Black Bulls?

129
00:07:48,940 --> 00:07:51,580
What'd I miss, Noct?

130
00:07:51,680 --> 00:07:54,020
And who's this puny guy you're talking to?

131
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:55,260
That key?

132
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,220
A devil?

133
00:07:56,680 --> 00:08:00,240
I hate to tell you this, Gimodelo, but you're a whole lot punier than he is.

134
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:03,580
Don't even start!

135
00:08:03,880 --> 00:08:06,580
You're only saying that because I'm not in my true form!

136
00:08:06,780 --> 00:08:08,760
You're talking like best buddies.

137
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:11,660
You're possessed by a devil, too?

138
00:08:12,660 --> 00:08:13,340
Precisely.

139
00:08:13,720 --> 00:08:15,740
This little imp right here is Gimodelo.

140
00:08:19,880 --> 00:08:22,080
It's our crest, so it is true.

141
00:08:22,800 --> 00:08:24,340
Are you really our Vice Captain?

142
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,160
Yes.

143
00:08:26,840 --> 00:08:29,260
Although Yami basically decided that himself.

144
00:08:29,440 --> 00:08:30,700
Don't make me leave!

145
00:08:31,940 --> 00:08:33,940
This whole thing is so crazy.

146
00:08:34,280 --> 00:08:36,040
It's no surprise you don't know about me.

147
00:08:36,640 --> 00:08:38,820
After all, I've only been to the hideout once.

148
00:08:39,660 --> 00:08:40,660
And why is that?

149
00:08:40,660 --> 00:08:43,160
It's because I despise Yami.

150
00:08:44,840 --> 00:08:48,940
I hate to admit it, but stubborn people like him tend to be very resilient.

151
00:08:50,400 --> 00:08:52,540
He's still got some time left to live.

152
00:08:53,100 --> 00:08:53,660
But...

153
00:08:53,660 --> 00:08:55,960
How do you know that for sure?

154
00:08:57,040 --> 00:09:00,700
Well, I've been undercover in the Spade Kingdom for a long time now.

155
00:09:00,700 --> 00:09:06,560
I don't know much about you.

156
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:09,580
And I'm not even sure if I can trust you.

157
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:10,980
But...

158
00:09:10,980 --> 00:09:15,140
You're the only person who might know how to get Captain Yami back.

159
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,880
So please help me.

160
00:09:17,360 --> 00:09:19,980
Teach me everything you can about my devil power.

161
00:09:19,980 --> 00:09:21,440
Good.

162
00:09:21,580 --> 00:09:23,260
I'm glad to see you're straightforward.

163
00:09:23,640 --> 00:09:25,460
I quite like that trait in a person.

164
00:09:25,900 --> 00:09:27,140
Um, thank you.

165
00:09:27,480 --> 00:09:32,660
But as of right now, I can't say that I'm sensing even a smidgen of talent within you.

166
00:09:33,100 --> 00:09:33,460
Huh?

167
00:09:34,260 --> 00:09:35,860
Wow, tell me how you really feel.

168
00:09:35,860 --> 00:09:39,120
I'm sure it'll work out if you learn to use your powers.

169
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:40,240
Yeah?

170
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:41,360
Great, let's do it.

171
00:09:41,820 --> 00:09:44,020
Oh no, you need to get some rest first.

172
00:09:44,560 --> 00:09:44,860
Huh?

173
00:09:45,820 --> 00:09:49,100
There's somewhere I'd like to go with you tomorrow, so take it easy tonight.

174
00:09:50,220 --> 00:09:52,480
You expect me to be able to sleep right now?

175
00:09:53,020 --> 00:09:53,940
Just do it.

176
00:09:54,260 --> 00:09:55,560
I hate selfish people.

177
00:09:55,560 --> 00:10:06,200
Excellent.

178
00:10:06,780 --> 00:10:08,040
It seems you're all here.

179
00:10:12,680 --> 00:10:16,400
Now then, let's begin the emergency captain's meeting.

180
00:10:25,560 --> 00:10:35,760
This concludes the report from the Black Bulls who witnessed the attack.

181
00:10:36,460 --> 00:10:37,820
The Tree of Kleefoth.

182
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:40,620
It's supposed to connect this world to the Underworld.

183
00:10:41,100 --> 00:10:44,780
And to create it, they need the magic types that William and Yami possess.

184
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:45,920
I see.

185
00:10:46,400 --> 00:10:48,280
I still can't believe they kidnapped them.

186
00:10:48,620 --> 00:10:49,160
I can.

187
00:10:49,500 --> 00:10:51,540
Those two allowed themselves to be caught off guard.

188
00:10:51,540 --> 00:10:55,000
And they dare to call themselves Magic Knight Squad Captains?

189
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,900
Of just a couple of lousy men.

190
00:10:57,200 --> 00:10:58,080
Oh no!

191
00:10:58,500 --> 00:11:00,460
My sweet Yami's been abducted!

192
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,400
Is he alright?

193
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,460
I hope they haven't heard him!

194
00:11:04,020 --> 00:11:07,420
I haven't had a chance to confess my love to him yet!

195
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:09,740
We did everything that we could.

196
00:11:10,900 --> 00:11:12,560
And it still wasn't enough.

197
00:11:13,080 --> 00:11:15,500
The enemy wasn't even fighting us seriously.

198
00:11:16,260 --> 00:11:18,780
Yeah, that's a real likely story, kid.

199
00:11:19,120 --> 00:11:22,400
Sounds to me like you might have chickened out on the guy!

200
00:11:22,400 --> 00:11:26,860
Turns out the Golden Dawn's got a sniveling coward for a vice-captain!

201
00:11:26,860 --> 00:11:27,840
That's enough, Jack.

202
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:32,460
Those foul villains could be linking this world to the Underworld even as we speak.

203
00:11:32,680 --> 00:11:33,080
Care?

204
00:11:33,300 --> 00:11:35,760
Then it's all gonna be fire and brimstone, I guess.

205
00:11:36,200 --> 00:11:38,680
We must prevent that outcome at all costs.

206
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,220
Sadly, we don't have much information.

207
00:11:42,900 --> 00:11:43,380
Great!

208
00:11:43,380 --> 00:11:45,720
So we're all gonna sit around and talk about it.

209
00:11:46,040 --> 00:11:47,620
Genius plan you've got there.

210
00:11:48,320 --> 00:11:49,120
Forget it.

211
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:52,840
This stupid meeting obviously isn't going anywhere.

212
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:54,340
I'm out!

213
00:11:54,740 --> 00:11:55,300
Stop.

214
00:11:55,300 --> 00:12:00,920
You'd better not be thinking about going to infiltrate Spade on your own.

215
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,160
Yeah, right!

216
00:12:02,580 --> 00:12:04,240
Just to rescue that idiot?

217
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:08,260
Besides, even if I did, it's not like it would be any of your business!

218
00:12:08,720 --> 00:12:09,700
You're a fool!

219
00:12:10,040 --> 00:12:11,240
It is our business!

220
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:14,740
I won't allow a fellow captain to be so rash!

221
00:12:15,160 --> 00:12:17,240
Because I want to go save Yami, too!

222
00:12:17,240 --> 00:12:21,520
Well, it's better than just sitting here picking our noses all day!

223
00:12:22,100 --> 00:12:25,840
Believe me, Jack, I want the chance to kill that monster just as badly as you do.

224
00:12:26,400 --> 00:12:28,960
Everyone, settle down right now!

225
00:12:29,380 --> 00:12:30,100
Yowl what?

226
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,160
Lord Julius?

227
00:12:34,080 --> 00:12:36,700
Good to see you're all motivated at least.

228
00:12:38,040 --> 00:12:42,940
Still though, I dislike those who can't maintain proper civility.

229
00:12:43,420 --> 00:12:44,580
Uh, hi, captains!

230
00:12:44,580 --> 00:12:47,380
I'd appreciate it if you would quiet down.

231
00:12:48,140 --> 00:12:49,360
Set a better example.

232
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:50,700
Oh, stop.

233
00:12:51,280 --> 00:12:52,740
Who is this intruder?

234
00:12:53,260 --> 00:12:54,100
Declare yourself!

235
00:12:54,660 --> 00:12:55,260
Please.

236
00:12:59,280 --> 00:13:03,140
I can assure you that I have every right to be included in this meeting.

237
00:13:04,740 --> 00:13:06,520
Whoa, you've got four devils?

238
00:13:06,800 --> 00:13:08,420
I didn't expect that.

239
00:13:09,020 --> 00:13:09,720
Devils?

240
00:13:10,180 --> 00:13:12,060
So he's possessed as well.

241
00:13:12,060 --> 00:13:14,760
Tell us, who are you?

242
00:13:15,400 --> 00:13:17,140
This man is with the Black Bulls.

243
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:19,260
He's their vice-captain.

244
00:13:19,680 --> 00:13:20,420
Wait, seriously?

245
00:13:21,040 --> 00:13:24,020
He'd been operating in the Spade Kingdom as a spy.

246
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:26,940
However, I was unaware that he was possessed.

247
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:30,060
So that's the vice-captain of the Black Bulls?

248
00:13:30,420 --> 00:13:32,560
I didn't realize we had sent a spy.

249
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:36,720
I suppose the vice-captain of Yami's squad could be practically anyone.

250
00:13:38,100 --> 00:13:39,920
Have I seen this jerk?

251
00:13:42,720 --> 00:13:44,340
Wait, I remember you?

252
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:47,320
Your magic is different now, though.

253
00:13:47,440 --> 00:13:48,720
That man is no more.

254
00:13:48,720 --> 00:13:54,340
Anyway, we're wasting time.

255
00:13:54,880 --> 00:13:56,640
I suggest we get straight to the point.

256
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,400
I'd like you all to have a seat.

257
00:14:01,560 --> 00:14:05,820
As you know, the Gate to the Underworld is about to be opened in the Spade Kingdom.

258
00:14:05,820 --> 00:14:11,960
So, we can assume they're already making preparations for the ritual of the advent of Klyphoth.

259
00:14:12,900 --> 00:14:17,440
To do so, they'll undoubtedly offer Yami and Vangeans as sacrifices.

260
00:14:19,340 --> 00:14:20,360
Captain Yami.

261
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:26,460
When that's done, the advent of Klyphoth will begin, lasting for seven days.

262
00:14:27,060 --> 00:14:30,400
Seven levels, with seven gates, will open one by one.

263
00:14:31,100 --> 00:14:35,500
Scattered throughout these gates are ten devils, each compatible with the Klyphoth.

264
00:14:36,100 --> 00:14:38,920
The deeper the level, the stronger the enemies will be.

265
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:43,340
The upper ones are about as powerful as the Dark Triad members.

266
00:14:43,840 --> 00:14:46,180
But as you descend, they become much fiercer.

267
00:14:46,940 --> 00:14:47,760
What's worse?

268
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:53,340
If the final devil, Lucifero, emerges, this world is done for.

269
00:14:54,780 --> 00:14:57,420
Yami and Vangeans will be killed by this process.

270
00:14:58,320 --> 00:15:02,320
But as the catalysts, they'll be kept alive until the last gate opens.

271
00:15:04,140 --> 00:15:04,660
Impressive.

272
00:15:05,480 --> 00:15:07,900
He managed to gain this much information on his own.

273
00:15:08,580 --> 00:15:11,280
And from the very heart of the enemy's country, no less.

274
00:15:11,940 --> 00:15:15,280
But why would the Dark Triad want to attempt something that's so dangerous?

275
00:15:15,280 --> 00:15:18,060
It isn't the kind of thing we could ever understand.

276
00:15:19,200 --> 00:15:23,400
As Magic Knights, I'm sure you've met more than your share of people like them.

277
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:29,180
Those who care only about themselves and hurt without hesitation to satisfy their own desire.

278
00:15:29,880 --> 00:15:33,400
Who feel no guilt or shame no matter how low they sink.

279
00:15:33,400 --> 00:15:38,000
Personally, I would never even want to understand what motivates them.

280
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:41,000
They are the worst sort of trash imaginable.

281
00:15:42,060 --> 00:15:43,020
Irrational evil.

282
00:15:43,680 --> 00:15:44,900
There's nothing I hate more.

283
00:15:48,060 --> 00:15:50,960
Perhaps God and the devils will forgive them for what they've done.

284
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:52,620
But I never will.

285
00:15:52,620 --> 00:15:59,200
That being said, I can't defeat the Dark Triad without help.

286
00:15:59,980 --> 00:16:01,880
I'm aware of my own limitations.

287
00:16:02,780 --> 00:16:05,160
I won't attempt something beyond my abilities.

288
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:06,620
Which is why...

289
00:16:07,360 --> 00:16:09,080
I'll make him the warrior we need.

290
00:16:11,540 --> 00:16:14,080
We'll harness the potential of his anti-magic.

291
00:16:14,080 --> 00:16:18,840
In three days, the Gate to the Underworld will be opened.

292
00:16:19,320 --> 00:16:24,380
Before that happens, we're going to take back Yami and Vangeance and destroy the Tree of Klyphov.

293
00:16:25,480 --> 00:16:29,560
Using my magic, we'll be able to infiltrate their castle without being detected.

294
00:16:30,260 --> 00:16:33,740
Once inside, we'll attack the Dark Triad and take each of them down.

295
00:16:35,020 --> 00:16:37,340
Dante has gravity and body magic.

296
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:40,180
Vanica has curse warding and blood magic.

297
00:16:40,880 --> 00:16:43,000
Xenon has spatial and bone magic.

298
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:44,300
Xenon.

299
00:16:44,920 --> 00:16:47,100
I won't be able to take many people with me.

300
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:53,260
We need to select a group that has the best chance of success against the devils, with Asta at its center.

301
00:16:54,360 --> 00:16:56,400
Yeah! No wonder you're here then!

302
00:16:56,660 --> 00:16:59,860
Clearly squad captains are the ones you want for this kind of thing!

303
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:01,320
Let me go.

304
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:04,140
I know it's impudent to ask.

305
00:17:04,660 --> 00:17:06,740
But please, let me join you.

306
00:17:07,620 --> 00:17:09,000
Are you stupid?

307
00:17:09,720 --> 00:17:12,880
Like hell we're gonna send anyone who's already lost to them!

308
00:17:13,640 --> 00:17:14,260
Yuno.

309
00:17:14,260 --> 00:17:16,420
I understand how you feel right now.

310
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:20,660
But staying behind to protect the Clover Kingdom is also a vital task.

311
00:17:21,260 --> 00:17:21,600
Yuno.

312
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:25,060
Actually, I did want to ask you something.

313
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:31,400
There's a resistance movement in the Spade Kingdom that seeks to undermine the Dark Triad's rule.

314
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:36,600
Not long ago, a member of this movement snuck across the border and into Clover.

315
00:17:37,280 --> 00:17:39,220
He's at your hideout now, isn't he?

316
00:17:39,820 --> 00:17:40,720
What's this?

317
00:17:41,720 --> 00:17:44,440
Tell me, who are you really?

318
00:17:44,440 --> 00:17:52,200
Apparently, I'm the Prince of the Spade Kingdom.

319
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,200
Prince!

320
00:17:53,200 --> 00:17:54,200
Prince!

321
00:17:54,200 --> 00:17:55,540
No freaking way!

322
00:17:55,540 --> 00:17:56,460
Come on!

323
00:17:56,460 --> 00:17:58,300
You're not serious about this, are you?

324
00:17:58,300 --> 00:17:59,560
No freaking way!

325
00:17:59,560 --> 00:18:00,500
Come on!

326
00:18:00,560 --> 00:18:02,300
You're not serious about this, are you?

327
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:03,100
Yes.

328
00:18:04,000 --> 00:18:06,720
I was a newborn when the royal family was overthrown.

329
00:18:07,540 --> 00:18:09,640
Someone smuggled me out and brought me to Clover.

330
00:18:10,580 --> 00:18:11,100
I see.

331
00:18:11,320 --> 00:18:12,040
He's royalty.

332
00:18:12,260 --> 00:18:14,700
That explains the tremendous amount of mana he has.

333
00:18:15,720 --> 00:18:16,960
The man you mentioned before.

334
00:18:17,620 --> 00:18:19,980
He was loyal to the previous rulers of Spade.

335
00:18:20,780 --> 00:18:23,140
He should know a great deal about the enemy and the castle.

336
00:18:23,860 --> 00:18:24,180
Yeah!

337
00:18:24,560 --> 00:18:26,940
That's even more reason not to let you in on this!

338
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:29,540
For all we know, that guy's an enemy spy!

339
00:18:30,120 --> 00:18:31,560
And not just him either!

340
00:18:31,560 --> 00:18:33,660
Who says you're not a spy yourself?

341
00:18:34,880 --> 00:18:36,940
If I don't save him, then there's no point.

342
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:38,520
You don't understand.

343
00:18:39,460 --> 00:18:42,200
Since the elves attacked, you've been cautious.

344
00:18:42,740 --> 00:18:45,320
You weren't sure you could still trust Captain Vongens.

345
00:18:46,220 --> 00:18:48,020
And I can't blame you for that.

346
00:18:48,860 --> 00:18:51,480
He couldn't choose between the humans and the elves.

347
00:18:52,300 --> 00:18:53,780
And our kingdom suffered.

348
00:18:54,780 --> 00:18:57,840
But that's exactly why, no matter how much he's hurting,

349
00:18:57,840 --> 00:19:01,220
he continues to fight more earnestly than anyone else.

350
00:19:01,860 --> 00:19:03,380
I was defeated by Xenon.

351
00:19:04,120 --> 00:19:07,320
But I remember, as I was blacking out,

352
00:19:07,320 --> 00:19:09,640
while he fought,

353
00:19:10,420 --> 00:19:13,860
Captain Vongens did his best to keep the Golden Dawn safe.

354
00:19:13,860 --> 00:19:17,280
If you rid yourself of some of that baggage,

355
00:19:17,360 --> 00:19:19,800
you'd be able to focus more of your strength on our battle.

356
00:19:20,120 --> 00:19:21,980
But you won't do that, will you?

357
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:26,200
And that's exactly why you're going to lose.

358
00:19:26,200 --> 00:19:28,660
Of course I won't abandon them.

359
00:19:28,660 --> 00:19:33,220
I made them walk a path of thorns, but they rose again.

360
00:19:33,720 --> 00:19:36,820
They forged ahead without resentment or regret.

361
00:19:37,820 --> 00:19:39,840
They are all I could ask them to be!

362
00:19:40,040 --> 00:19:41,380
They are my dream!

363
00:19:41,380 --> 00:19:44,480
He was only captured because he was protecting us.

364
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:47,020
He could have saved himself, but he didn't.

365
00:19:47,820 --> 00:19:51,060
Maybe to you he's a traitor who once turned his back on this kingdom.

366
00:19:51,800 --> 00:19:53,080
But to us he's not.

367
00:19:53,560 --> 00:19:55,960
He's everything a squad captain should be.

368
00:19:56,880 --> 00:19:57,420
You know.

369
00:19:57,420 --> 00:20:01,600
That monster thinks he annihilated the Golden Dawn.

370
00:20:01,940 --> 00:20:02,680
He's wrong.

371
00:20:03,340 --> 00:20:06,660
Thanks to the captain's magic, we're alive and ready to fight back.

372
00:20:07,360 --> 00:20:08,960
This war is far from over.

373
00:20:09,680 --> 00:20:11,700
The Golden Dawn is still standing.

374
00:20:12,300 --> 00:20:14,880
The greatest magic knight squad in the Clover Kingdom!

375
00:20:14,880 --> 00:20:18,680
I'm going to prove that he did the right thing when he protected us.

376
00:20:19,660 --> 00:20:22,300
They'll see just how powerful we are.

377
00:20:22,300 --> 00:20:26,540
I will be the one who saves Captain Vongence.

378
00:20:27,520 --> 00:20:29,320
The hell's up with this mana?

379
00:20:30,260 --> 00:20:30,820
Enough!

380
00:20:31,200 --> 00:20:33,540
Just sit down and shut up already, will ya?

381
00:20:33,720 --> 00:20:36,200
Instead, how about you shut up?

382
00:20:37,060 --> 00:20:39,560
I'm kind of busy storing up mana here.

383
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:42,700
We're going to take down that bony bastard!

384
00:20:43,540 --> 00:20:45,380
Yuna won't lose to him again!

385
00:20:46,180 --> 00:20:47,180
Very well, Yuren.

386
00:20:47,820 --> 00:20:49,760
I don't actually hate people like you.

387
00:20:49,760 --> 00:20:54,060
You may be the Prince of the Spade Kingdom and the Vice-Captain of the Golden Dawn,

388
00:20:54,140 --> 00:20:55,720
but you'll always be Yuno to me.

389
00:20:56,260 --> 00:21:00,360
In three days, we'll depart early in the morning for the Spade Kingdom.

390
00:21:00,900 --> 00:21:03,340
I'll send you a more detailed plan later on.

391
00:21:04,180 --> 00:21:06,080
This time, we're on the offensive.

392
00:21:07,360 --> 00:21:11,580
Now that I see how Yuno's handling this, I understand there's no time to cry.

393
00:21:12,060 --> 00:21:15,000
If I was too weak to win, that means I need to be stronger.

394
00:21:15,640 --> 00:21:15,980
No.

395
00:21:15,980 --> 00:21:19,540
I'll push past my limits and become the strongest.

396
00:21:20,760 --> 00:21:24,580
Let's go defeat the Dark Triad and save both our captains.

397
00:21:25,220 --> 00:21:25,760
Right.

398
00:21:26,800 --> 00:21:30,600
In that case, we'd better reach out to Heart for assistance as well.

399
00:21:31,040 --> 00:21:33,400
I've tried, but they haven't answered me all day.

400
00:21:33,940 --> 00:21:34,280
What?

401
00:21:34,640 --> 00:21:37,260
Do you think something happened to Charmy and everyone else?

402
00:21:37,260 --> 00:21:41,460
Yesterday, each Dark Triad member left their castle.

403
00:21:42,040 --> 00:21:45,900
Knowing that, I'd wager Vanica went off to attack the Heart Kingdom.

404
00:21:46,300 --> 00:21:47,100
You think so?

405
00:21:47,100 --> 00:22:03,340
I don't believe it.

406
00:22:03,340 --> 00:22:31,720
I don't believe it.

407
00:22:31,720 --> 00:22:47,300
胸にしまい込んだままの想いを解き放って その翼を広げて one more time

408
00:22:47,300 --> 00:23:03,380
今飛び立て あの海原を見下ろして 誰よりも遠く 何度でも Will you fly?

409
00:23:03,380 --> 00:23:16,740
Beautiful どんな景色も 君といれば輝くよ だからずっとそばに

410
00:23:16,740 --> 00:23:31,860
Beautiful and never let go 僕のこの手を離さないで どこまでも ついてきてほしい

411
00:23:31,860 --> 00:23:35,060
The world is so beautiful

412
00:23:37,060 --> 00:23:45,060
No way! So the vice-captain of the black bulls can use devil power too? Okay! What kind of training are we gonna do to make me the best?

413
00:23:45,060 --> 00:23:50,660
Black Clover page 169 The Devil Binding Ritual

